{"text": "At last Jemima said, Tomorrow I am going to sit on my eggs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I will bring some corn, so I will not need to leave my nest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Madam, before you start sitting, let us have a dinner party, said the gentleman. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Please bring some herbs from the farm garden to make an omelette. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Bring sage, thyme, mint and parsley, and two onions as well. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Jemima was a simple duck, and even sage and onions did not worry her. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She picked herbs in the garden and took two onions from the kitchen. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Kep, the wise collie dog, met her on her way out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> What are you doing with those onions, Jemima, he asked. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Jemima told him the whole story, and Kep listened with his head on one side. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he trotted to the village to find two fox hound puppies.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "t", " ", "l", "a", "s", "t", " ", "J", "e", "m", "i", "m", "a", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", ",", " ", "T", "o", "m", "o", "r", "r", "o", "w", " ", "I", " ", "a", "m", " ", "g", "o", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "o", " ", "s", "i", "t", " ", "o", "n", " ", "m", "y", " ", "e", "g", "g", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", " ", "w", "i", "l", "l", " ", "b", "r", "i", "n", "g", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e", " ", "c", "o", "r", "n", ",", " ", "s", "o", " ", "I", " ", "w", "i", "l", "l", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "n", "e", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "l", "e", "a", "v", "e", " ", "m", "y", " ", "n", "e", "s", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "M", "a", "d", "a", "m", ",", " ", "b", "e", "f", "o", "r", "e", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "s", "t", "a", "r", "t", " ", "s", "i", "t", "t", "i", "n", "g", ",", " ", "l", "e", "t